items.Upgrade_Watering.name = Watering Upgrade
items.Upgrade_Watering.description = Right-click a Harvester to install: it keeps the tilled soil of its area watered. Crouch + F on the Harvester removes the last upgrade.
items.Upgrade_Fertilizer.name = Fertilizer Upgrade
items.Upgrade_Fertilizer.description = Turns your animals' manure into fertilizer. Right-click a Harvester to install: it fertilizes planted soil in its area using the Poop your livestock drops in the field (2 per soil block by default) and then Fertilizer bags from any slot of the Harvester (and keeps the bags and up to 100 Poop by default out of the export). Crouch + F on the Harvester removes the last upgrade.
items.Upgrade_Planter.name = Planter Upgrade
items.Upgrade_Planter.description = Right-click a Harvester to install: it plants the seeds from any of its slots (lowest slot first) on every empty soil block of its area the seed grows on, and tree saplings on grass or dirt on a grid every 4 blocks (only where the space around is free). Keeps up to 64 of each seed or sapling out of the export by default. Crouch + F on the Harvester removes the last upgrade.
